<tool id="zarr_create" name="ZarrCreate" version="1.0.0">
  <description>Create zarr</description>
  <command><![CDATA[
    python '$__tool_directory__/zarr_create.py' zarr_test &&
    mv zarr_test '${zarr_file.files_path}'
  ]]></command>
  <requirements>
    <requirement type="package" version="2.16.1">zarr</requirement>
    <requirement type="package" version="2023.10.1">xarray</requirement>
    <requirement type="package" version="1.24.4">numpy</requirement>
    <requirement type="package" version="2.1.2">pandas</requirement>
  </requirements>
  <inputs>
  </inputs>
    <outputs>
        <data format="zarr" name="zarr_file" label="${tool.name} on ${on_string}: ZARR" />
    </outputs>
  <help>

**What it does**

Creates a zarr test file.


  </help>
  <citations>
  </citations>
</tool>
